@ApiGateway_HostAddress = https://localhost:5000

GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### User management: paste an access token from login
@userAccessToken = paste-access-token-here
@managedUserId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### My profile
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}

### Replace editable profile fields
PUT {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "phoneNumber": "0901234567",
  "avatarUrl": null
}

### Admin: search users
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=20&search=
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}

### Admin: user detail
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{managedUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}

### Admin: lock account and revoke sessions
PATCH {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{managedUserId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

### Admin: existing roles
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}

### Admin: create employee (replace roleId with an existing role)
POST {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "nhanvien01",
  "email": "nhanvien01@example.com",
  "password": "EmployeePass123!",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "roleId": "REPLACE_WITH_EXISTING_ROLE"
}

### Admin: change role and revoke sessions
PATCH {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{managedUserId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roleId": "REPLACE_WITH_EXISTING_ROLE" }
